  <item>
    <title>04 心里话｜成功就是一连串的失败</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/605b61db64b27cf2f137f32e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">605b61db64b27cf2f137f32e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 24 Mar 2021 15:54:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如何减弱对于「失败」的非理性恐惧？</span></p><span></span><p><span>你将听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span>- ‘Learn to fail or fail to learn‘</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 对失败的解释可以用三个维度衡量：永久性/普遍性/个人化 （permanant，pervasive，personal）</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 通过了解榜样的失败经历，来克服对于失败的非理性恐惧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客中提到</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. Cisco创始人Sandy Lerner</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. Lululemon创始人Chip Wilson</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. Linkedin 创始人Reid Hoffmann</span></p><span></span><p><span>4. 年更主播张潇雨</span></p><span></span><p><span>5. 咨询师李松蔚</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 控制失败风险的两个策略</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 主播不二准备挑战极限，用三句话给自己壮胆</span></p><span></span><p><span>参考资料：</span></p><span></span><p><span>哈佛 positive psychology 课程 老师是Tal</span></p><span></span><p><span>《活出乐观的自己》作者是积极心理学之父塞利格曼</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/5e284c63418a84a04626511a?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlODQ2ZmE4YWRiZWQ4OTc0OWE0NWFiYSJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/5e284c63418a84a04626511a?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlODQ2ZmE4YWRiZWQ4OTc0OWE0NWFiYSJ9"><span>How I built this &nbsp;Sandy Lerner&nbsp;</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>播客 醉创业</span></p><span></span><p><span>壮胆诗句来自里尔克的诗《观看的男人》</span></p><span></span><p><span>特沃斯基的话引自《思维的发现》</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐阅读：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《重新理解创业》，易到用车创始人周航复盘自己创业失败的历程</span></p><span></span><p><span>《大败局》，作者吴晓波</span></p><span></span><p><span>得到平台课程《商业经典案例课》中的「小败局」系列</span></p><span></span><p><span>「见贤思齐」致力于分享卓越人物的人生故事，并从中提炼出值得学习的策略、习惯和洞察。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：不二，即刻、微博 @富于理性</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听，期待反馈！</span></p>]]></description>
